        {
          "es": "Del otro lado del mar, en Java, vivía un hombre santo llamado Sidhi Mantra.",
          "en": "Across the sea, in Java, lived a holy man named Sidhi Mantra."
        },
        {
          "es": "Era un sacerdote sabio, y la gente venía de lejos a pedirle su bendición.",
          "en": "He was a wise priest, and people came from far away to ask for his blessing."
        },
        {
          "es": "Tenía un solo hijo, Manik Angkeran. El muchacho era listo, fuerte y apuesto.",
          "en": "He had one son, Manik Angkeran. The boy was clever, strong and handsome."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero tenía una debilidad. No podía dejar de apostar.",
          "en": "But he had one weakness. He could not stop gambling."
        }
