      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Manik Angkeran sintió vergüenza. Pidió quedarse en Bali y servir en el templo de la montaña, Besakih.",
          "en": "Manik Angkeran was ashamed. He asked to stay in Bali, and serve at the temple on the mountain, Besakih."
        },
        {
          "es": "Su padre aceptó. Pero quería estar seguro de que su hijo nunca volvería a su vieja vida.",
          "en": "His father agreed. But he wanted to be sure his son would never return to his old life."
        },
        {
          "es": "De regreso a casa, trazó una línea sobre la tierra con su bastón.",
          "en": "On his way home, he drew a line across the land with his walking stick."
        },
        {
          "es": "El mar entró por esa línea, y Java y Bali quedaron separadas.",
          "en": "The sea rushed in through the line, and Java and Bali were split apart."
        },
        {
          "es": "El agua que hay entre ellas se llama el estrecho de Bali.",
          "en": "The water between them is called the Bali Strait."
        }
